WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.770
Catlin also painted action.
In Buffalo Chase, A Single Death,

2
00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:07.510
a mounted hunter drives a lance
into a buffalo.

3
00:00:08.120 --> 00:00:10.450
It's thrilling, and that's the point.

4
00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:13.950
Catlin presents the hunt
as an exotic spectacle.

5
00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:18.450
But for the people who did it,
this was skilled, organized work:

6
00:00:18.540 --> 00:00:22.330
a present-day economy
that fed families and supported trade.

7
00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:25.870
Calling something traditional
can make it seem old-fashioned,

8
00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:28.170
even when it is happening right now.
